  "body": "Connect automatic, supervised and real provider worker entry points to one Issue/envelope validator. Preserve Noodle's canonical initial admission and require quiescent process readback before supervised continuation. The existing landing owner now checks body and actual path boundaries and waits for the original Noodle order before cleanup.\n\nDraft: 19 focused admission/execution controls and 38 landing controls pass locally. Full Linux acceptance, planted-defect evidence, physical automatic-to-supervised proof and final provider delivery remain to be completed. This branch matches the Noodle-owned worktree identity required by the landing owner; it supersedes the preliminary draft #37.\n\nRefs ed3c/soodles#18",
